1.. Presentation of Certificate of Commendation Recognizing Police Detective Daniel Brandt as the 2024 Police Officer of the Year, Firefighter Michael Shields as the 2024 Firefighter of the Year, and Police Background Investigator Michelle Arellano as the 2024 Police Professional Staff of the Year.
PRESENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa160\sl252\slmult1\i\f0\fs22 On behalf of the City Council, Mayor Howorth with the aid of Police Chief Rachel Johnson and Interim Fire Chief Mike Lang, presented the following Certificates of Commendation to:\line\line\ul 2024 Police Officer of the Year\ulnone\line Police Detective Daniel Brandt\line\line\ul 2024 Police Professional Staff of the Year\ulnone\line Police Background Investigator Michelle Arellano\line\line\ul 2024 Firefighter of the Year\ulnone\line Firefighter Michael Shields\line\line\pard A moment of silence was held for City of Baldwin Park Police Officer Samuel Riveros who was tragically killed in the line of duty over the weekend.\cf1\i0\f1\par
}


